<title>PHILIPPINES: Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</title>
<headline>Philippine govt securities secondary market rates.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are secondary market rates quoted by banks on Tuesday for Philippine government securities. The rates are indicative as maturities are slightly varying.</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>  BANK		     RATES BID/OFFER PCT</p>
<p>				3-mths	   6-mths	  1-year</p>
<p>Bank of America	11.15 /11.05  11.60 /11.50   11.80/11.60</p>
<p>Citibank		 11.25 /11.20  11.50 /11.375  11.80 /11.625</p>
<p>Metrobank		10.90 /10.75  11.30 /11.20   11.60 /11.40</p>
<p>Multinational	  11.25 /11.00  11.50 /11.20   11.75 /11.40</p>
<p>PNB			11.05 /10.95  11.30 /11.20   11.70 /11.60</p>
<p>PCIBank		  11.05 /10.90  11.20 /11.00   11.55 /11.45</p>
<p>Solidbank		11.00 /10.90  11.15 /11.05   11.65 /11.55</p>
<p>Standard Chartered   11.00 /10.80  11.30 /11.10   11.80 /11.60</p>
<p>			     ---------------</p>
<p>* To contribute to this page, please fax your quotes to Reuters Manila newsroom on (632) 817 6267. For details, please phone (632) 841 8934</p>
